      "text": "$BTC That is a good example of how we often see the start of new months & quarters.\n\nLots of volatility, choppy price action and liquidity sweeps.\n\nUsually price starts to form some sort of direction by day 5-10 which holds for the ~2 weeks following.\n\nIn this case I think $84K (Friday low) and $87K (Friday high) are good levels to watch for a break to see where this wants to go next.",
