        "id": "2105569477127803264",
        "text": "The end and start of the month and quarter are usually choppy and love sweeping liquidity (on both sides).\n\nNot the place where you want to position yourself directionally straight away usually.\n\nUsually best to let it play out some days and then reassess.",
